# Copy to .env.local for local development, or add these as Environment Variables in the
# Vercel project dashboard (Settings > Environment Variables) for production.

# MHCLG "Get Energy Performance Data" API — domestic EPC lookups (England & Wales).
# Register (free) at https://get-energy-performance-data.communities.gov.uk and copy the
# "My Bearer token" value from your account page. Read only server-side (src/app/api/epc/route.ts)
# — never exposed to the browser. Without it, EPC lookups degrade gracefully to "not configured"
# rather than erroring.
EPC_API_TOKEN=
